# Deliberately empty.
#
# The local overlay bind-mounts the caytu-client source tree into the container,
# which drags a developer's own backend/.env in with it. dotenv then fills in
# whatever compose did not set explicitly, so REDIS_HOST=localhost on someone's
# laptop becomes REDIS_HOST=localhost inside the container and the backend spends
# thirty retries dialling 127.0.0.1.
#
# Mounting this file over /app/.env makes the container ignore it. The
# developer's file keeps working for `yarn dev` outside docker.
